    "id": "pose_48_one_knee_up_looking_up",
    "name": "One knee up, looking up with a hand at the chin",
    "description": "Kneeling with the right knee down and the left knee standing up with the foot flat, the torso upright and the chin raised to look up. The left hand touches the chin with the elbow open out to the side and the right hand rests on the right thigh. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the elbow cannot prop on the knee while the hand reaches the chin on this rig, so the arm reads as a hand-to-chin gesture with the elbow out.",
      "Right knee, right toes and left sole share floor contact; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/lib.py + /tmp/author_stand2.py (poses-only scope; authoring script not committed)"
  },
